{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to config.json and fill in real values.",
    "config.json is gitignored - never commit it, it holds credentials.",
    "",
    "Precedence: environment variable > config.json > hard failure.",
    "Environment variables always win, so a deployment that injects env vars",
    "(Render, Docker, systemd) does not need this file at all.",
    "",
    "There is deliberately NO fallback password in settings.py. If neither the",
    "environment nor this file supplies superadmin.password, no Super Admin is",
    "auto-created on migrate - which is the safe outcome. It is never a weak",
    "default one."
  ],

  "superadmin": {
    "email": "superadmin@example.com",
    "username": "superadmin",
    "password": "REPLACE-WITH-A-STRONG-PASSWORD"
  }
}
